    "detailed_description": "Hi, I am LIO, the main producer of this game. When I was a child, I was always fascinated by the &quot;Guess Who I Am&quot; segment in Pok\u00e9mon cartoons. The ability to recognize different creatures just by their silhouettes was amazing! Even in real life, various shapes like a leaf or irregular tiles often sparked my imagination about monsters.<br>This game follows the same concept. In the world of Wandaland, you can collect a variety of creatures by unlocking different shapes. <br>All the creatures are formed by the division and combination of &quot;cells&quot;. During gameplay, the focus is on observing the shapes rather than thinking.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444180/extras/8bef39424a3d1d849de4851513e5977d.poster.avif?t=1689940949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444180/extras/8bef39424a3d1d849de4851513e5977d.webm?t=1689940949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444180/extras/8bef39424a3d1d849de4851513e5977d.mp4?t=1689940949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gameplay instructions: The red cells will not retain the intersecting parts, while the blue cells will behave in the opposite way. Right-click to toggle the colors.<br><br>Game content: Includes six scenes from the deep sea to outer space, with a total of 48 levels.<br>Total gameplay time: Approximately one hour.<br>Game features: Cute artwork and relaxing music.<br>If you are interested, thank you for purchasing! \u2764\ufe0f<br>****Due to the departure of the programmer, there will be no modifications or updates****",
    "about_the_game": "Hi, I am LIO, the main producer of this game. When I was a child, I was always fascinated by the &quot;Guess Who I Am&quot; segment in Pok\u00e9mon cartoons. The ability to recognize different creatures just by their silhouettes was amazing! Even in real life, various shapes like a leaf or irregular tiles often sparked my imagination about monsters.<br>This game follows the same concept. In the world of Wandaland, you can collect a variety of creatures by unlocking different shapes. <br>All the creatures are formed by the division and combination of &quot;cells&quot;. During gameplay, the focus is on observing the shapes rather than thinking.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444180/extras/8bef39424a3d1d849de4851513e5977d.poster.avif?t=1689940949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444180/extras/8bef39424a3d1d849de4851513e5977d.webm?t=1689940949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444180/extras/8bef39424a3d1d849de4851513e5977d.mp4?t=1689940949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gameplay instructions: The red cells will not retain the intersecting parts, while the blue cells will behave in the opposite way. Right-click to toggle the colors.<br><br>Game content: Includes six scenes from the deep sea to outer space, with a total of 48 levels.<br>Total gameplay time: Approximately one hour.<br>Game features: Cute artwork and relaxing music.<br>If you are interested, thank you for purchasing! \u2764\ufe0f<br>****Due to the departure of the programmer, there will be no modifications or updates****",
